WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.095
Hey guys, it's Ethan from Top Tin

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:02.400
Roofing.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.700
We've just finished up this massive roof.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.100
How did you find everything, Henry?

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:07.040
Yeah, it was really great.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.606
From start to finish, the guys put

00:00:09.646 --> 00:00:10.840
in an awesome effort.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.880
Worked really hard, big hours.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.520
I'm just so happy with the job.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.000
The missus is really happy.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.840
It's cost effective for me.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.744
It was a fast process and everything

00:00:20.784 --> 00:00:21.560
was so streamlined.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.640
I really appreciate it.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.680
Thank you.
